000300 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000400 PROGRAM-ID.    TCHKBLKT.
000600 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000800*REMARKS.
000900*
001000*    ON OCT 26, 1984, CHANGED THIS SUB-PROGRAM TO RETURN A
001100*    ZERO IN "NUMBER OF BLANKETS" PARAMETER IF NO BLANKET
001200*    ORDERS WERE FOUND.  CIH.
001300*
001400******************************************************
001500*                                                    *
001600*   T C H K B L K T                                  *
001700*                                                    *
001800*   THIS SUBROUTINE DETERMINES IF A CODE IS ON A     *
001900*   REQUIREMENT ORDER AND COUNTS HOW MANY EXIST,     *
002000*   HOW MANY HAVE NOT EXPIRED, AND PASSES THE        *
002100*   NUMBER OF THE FIRST UNEXPIRED REQUIREMENT        *
002200*   ORDER THAT IS FOUND.  REQUIREMENT ORDERS ARE     *
002300*   IDENTIFIED WITH A '999' IN THE RELEASE FIELD     *
002400*                                                    *
002500******************************************************
002600*
002700*    APRIL 17, 1985
002800*     1. TBLOWUP IS NOW CALLED FOR BLOWUPS WITHIN THE SUBROUTINE
002900*        ITSELF.
003000*          KURT MOVSESIAN.
003100*
      *C   10JAN1995   DAVE PLUM
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO UTILIZE THE PASSED PARAMETERS R11-SMALL-PO
      *C    AND R11-LARGE-PO.  THIS LOGIC EXISTED IN THE HP-3000 VERSION
      *C    OF THIS PROGRAM, BUT WAS MYSTERIOUSLY MISSING FROM THE AS/400.
      *C
      *C   06/06/96    JEFF BUNGO
      *C    EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C    ADD CENTURY TO CURRENT WORKING STORAGE DATE FOR
      *C    FOR COMPARISON OF PO EXPECT DATE.
      *C
      *C   03/23/00    JIM COFFMAN
      *C    ALTER REQUIREMENT ORDER SELECTION CRITERIA FOR DANVILLE
      *C    ISC ORDERS. A PROBLEM OCCURRED WHEREBY FRANCHISED-CODED
      *C    ITEMS WERE BEING ORDERED FROM PAYABLE REQUIREMENT ORDERS.
      *C    JANE TURNER ASKED THAT ONLY THE NONPAY REQUIREMENT ORDERS
      *C    BE SELECTABLE FOR FRANCHISE-DESIGNATED CORPORATE CODES.
      *C
003200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
003300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003500 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DPOITEM
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1001
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPORECD
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

003600
003900 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DPOITEM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOITEM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1000  OF MCFLCS1001.

       FD  DPORECD
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0900  OF MCFLCS0901.

       FD  MSTORERM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

004100
004200
004300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004400 77  FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLK-SW     PIC X   VALUE "N".
       77  ISC-OK-SW                  PIC X   VALUE "Y".
004500 77  QTY-ON-DOCK                PIC S9(8)V9(4) COMP VALUE ZEROS.
004600 77  STR-QTY-ON-DOCK            PIC S9(8)      COMP VALUE ZEROS.
004700
004800**************************************************************
004900**************************************************************
005000**                                                          **
005100**                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
005200**                                                          **
005300**************************************************************
005400**************************************************************
005500
005600 COPY DPOITEM    IN COPYLIB.
005700
005800 COPY DPORECD    IN COPYLIB.
005900
006000 COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.
006100
006200*********************
006300*                   *
006400*   DATA SET NAMES  *
006500*                   *
006600*********************
006700
006800 01  DSET-NAMES.
006900     05  DSET-DPOITEM           PIC X(16)  VALUE "DPOITEM;".
007000     05  DSET-DPORECD           PIC X(16)  VALUE "DPORECD;".
007100     05  DSET-MSTORERM          PIC X(16)  VALUE "MSTORERM;".
007200
007300 COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
007400
007500 COPY DBMODES    IN COPYLIB.
007600
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

007700 01 ITEMS-LISTING.
007800     05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC XX    VALUE "@;".
007900     05  CODE-SEARCH            PIC X(10) VALUE "CORP-CODE;".
008000     05  PO-SEARCH              PIC X(10) VALUE "PO-RCV-NO;".
008100
008200 01  ARG-VALUES.
008300     05  PO-ARG                 PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.
008400
008500
008600 COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
008700
008800 COPY VIEWDUM    IN COPYLIB.
008900
009000 01  DATES-AND-TIMES.
009100     05  HP-CUR-DATE.
009200         10  MM               PIC XX.
009300         10  FILLER           PIC X.
009400         10  DD               PIC XX.
009500         10  FILLER           PIC X.
009600         10  YY               PIC XX.
           05  CUR-DATE-CN.
               10  CC               PIC XX.
009700         10  CUR-DATE.
009800             15  YY           PIC XX.
009900             15  MM           PIC XX.
010000             15  DD           PIC XX.
010100
       01  IBM-DATE-WORK-CN.
           05  CC     PIC X(2).
           05  IBM-DATE-WORK.
               10  YY PIC X(2).
               10  MM PIC X(2).
               10  DD PIC X(2).
018000
010200
010300 LINKAGE SECTION.
010400
010500 01  BASE                       PIC X(10).
010600
010700 01  CODE-ARG                   PIC X(8).
010800
010900 COPY TCHKBLKT   IN COPYLIB.
011000
011100
011200 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING  BASE,
011300                           CODE-ARG,
011400                           CHKBLKT-PARMS.
011500
011600
011700 1-BEGIN.
           OPEN INPUT DPORECD, DPOITEM, MSTORERM.
011800     MOVE 0                TO  TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT.
           MOVE 0 TO QTY-ON-DOCK, STR-QTY-ON-DOCK.
           MOVE SPACES TO FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLK-SW.
011900     PERFORM 60-FIND-BLANKETS  THRU  60-FB-X.
012000
           CLOSE DPORECD, DPOITEM, MSTORERM.
012100     GOBACK.
012200
012300
012400 2-BLOWUP.
012500     MOVE "TCHKBLKT"              TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
012600     MOVE CODE-ARG                TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
012700     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
012800         VIEW-COMAREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
012900                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
013000
013100 2-BLOWUP-X.
013200     EXIT.
013300
013400
013500
013600 60-FIND-BLANKETS.
013700*    MOVE CURRENT-DATE            TO  HP-CUR-DATE.
013800*    MOVE CORRESPONDING HP-CUR-DATE  TO  CUR-DATE.
           ACCEPT IBM-DATE-WORK FROM DATE.
           IF YY OF IBM-DATE-WORK > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO CC OF IBM-DATE-WORK-CN
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO CC OF IBM-DATE-WORK-CN
           END-IF.
           MOVE IBM-DATE-WORK-CN TO CUR-DATE-CN.
013900     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT,
014000                                      UNEXPIRED-BLKT-COUNT,
014100                                      CHKBLKT-QTY-ON-DOCK.
014200     MOVE SPACES                  TO  FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLKT.
014300*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DPOITEM, MODE1,
014400*           STATUS-AREA, CODE-SEARCH, CODE-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC.
           START DPOITEM KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
014500     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
014600         MOVE "FIND DPOITEM * 60-FB"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
014700         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
014800
014900*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MSTORERM, MODE7,
015000*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MSTORERM, CODE-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC.
           READ MSTORERM INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
015100     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
015200         MOVE "GET MSTORERM * 60-FB"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
015300         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
015400
015500
015600 60-GET-AT-LEAST-ONE-BLKT.
015700*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DPOITEM, MODE5,
015800*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DPOITEM, CODE-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPOITEM NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM AT END
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC NOT = CODE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
015900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
016000         IF COND-WORD = 15
016100             GO TO 60-FB-X
016200         ELSE
016300             MOVE "GET DPOITEM *60-GALOB" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
016400             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
016500
      **************************************************************
      *    ADDED THE FOLLOWING LOGIC PER A JIM THOMAS VERBAL       *
      *    REQUEST TO NOT ALLOW THE NEW OUTSOURCING PERSONNEL IN   *
      *    DANVILLE TO SELECT 'ITOV' PURCHASE ORDERS FROM THE      *
      *    MA2 OPTION                                              *
      **************************************************************
           IF COMPANY-ID = "126"
               IF ITM-PO-NO-1-4 = "ITOV"
                   GO TO 60-GET-AT-LEAST-ONE-BLKT.

016600 60-CHECK-IF-BLKT.
016700     IF ITM-PO-REL  =  "999"
               IF COMPANY-ID = "126"
                   MOVE "Y" TO ISC-OK-SW
                   PERFORM 63-CHECK-ISC THRU 63-CI-X
                   IF ISC-OK-SW = "N"
                       GO TO 60-GET-AT-LEAST-ONE-BLKT
                   END-IF
               END-IF
016800         ADD  1  TO  TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT
016900         PERFORM 61-CHECK-EXPIRATION  THRU  61-CE-X
940110         IF R11-SMALL-PO = SPACES
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   IF ITM-PO-NO < R11-SMALL-PO
                       SUBTRACT 1 FROM TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT
                   ELSE
                       IF ITM-PO-NO > R11-LARGE-PO
                           SUBTRACT 1 FROM TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT
                       ELSE
                           NEXT SENTENCE
017000     ELSE
017100         PERFORM 62-CHECK-QTY-ON-DOCK  THRU  62-CQOD-X.
017200
017300     GO TO 60-GET-AT-LEAST-ONE-BLKT.
017400
017500 60-FB-X.
017600     EXIT.
017700
017800
017900 61-CHECK-EXPIRATION.
018000     MOVE ITM-PO-RCV-NO  TO  PO-ARG.
018100*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DPORECD, MODE1,
018200*           STATUS-AREA, PO-SEARCH, PO-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC.
           START DPORECD KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
018300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
018400         MOVE "FIND DPORECD * 61-CE"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
018500         MOVE PO-ARG                  TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
018600         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
018700
018800*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DPORECD, MODE5,
018900*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DPORECD, PO-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPORECD NEXT INTO BUF-DPORECD AT END
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC NOT = PO-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
019000     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
019100         MOVE "GET DPORECD * 61-CE"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
019200         MOVE PO-ARG               TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
019300         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
019400
019500     IF PO-EXPECT-DATE-CN  <  CUR-DATE-CN
019600         NEXT SENTENCE
019700     ELSE
019800         ADD 1  TO  UNEXPIRED-BLKT-COUNT
019900         IF FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLK-SW  =  "Y"
020000             NEXT SENTENCE
020100         ELSE
020200             MOVE ITM-PO-NO   TO  FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLKT
020300             MOVE "Y"         TO  FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLK-SW.
020400
020500 61-CE-X.
020600     EXIT.
020700
020800 62-CHECK-QTY-ON-DOCK.
020900     IF ITM-QTY-DLVR > ITM-QTY-STORED
021000         SUBTRACT ITM-QTY-STORED FROM ITM-QTY-DLVR GIVING
021100             QTY-ON-DOCK
021200         IF ITM-UM = STR-UM
021300             MULTIPLY QTY-ON-DOCK  BY 1 GIVING
021400                 STR-QTY-ON-DOCK ROUNDED
021500             ADD STR-QTY-ON-DOCK TO CHKBLKT-QTY-ON-DOCK
021600         ELSE
021700         IF ITM-UM = STR-UM1
021800             MULTIPLY QTY-ON-DOCK  BY  STR-UM1-CF GIVING
021900                 STR-QTY-ON-DOCK ROUNDED
022000             ADD STR-QTY-ON-DOCK  TO  CHKBLKT-QTY-ON-DOCK
022100         ELSE
022200         IF ITM-UM = STR-UM2
022300             MULTIPLY QTY-ON-DOCK  BY  STR-UM2-CF GIVING
022400                 STR-QTY-ON-DOCK ROUNDED
022500             ADD STR-QTY-ON-DOCK  TO  CHKBLKT-QTY-ON-DOCK.
022600
022700 62-CQOD-X.
022800     EXIT.

       63-CHECK-ISC.
           IF STR-CODE-OWNER = " " GO TO 63-CI-X.
           MOVE ITM-PO-RCV-NO TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC.
           READ DPORECD INTO BUF-DPORECD
               INVALID KEY    MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" GO TO 63-CI-X.
           IF PO-NONPAY-IND = " " MOVE "N" TO ISC-OK-SW.
       63-CI-X.    EXIT.
